-- RBAC 2/8 (epic #183, issue #185): membership integrity, indexes and ledger
-- tables. Expand phase: nothing is dropped and the previous app version keeps
-- working (see docs/DATABASE-MIGRATION.md, "RBAC 2/8 rollout").
--
-- Generated by drizzle-kit, then edited by hand: the data cleanup and the
-- backfills run before the unique indexes they enable, the CHECK constraints
-- (not emitted by drizzle-kit 0.24) are added, and the unique indexes on the
-- users table are created only when no duplicates exist. Every statement is
-- idempotent, so re-running the file is a no-op.
--
-- Plain CREATE INDEX (not CONCURRENTLY): drizzle runs a migration inside one
-- transaction, where CONCURRENTLY is not allowed. The tables are small enough
-- that the short write lock while an index builds is acceptable.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. New tables: quarantine, role ledger, event audit log
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
